@startuml UC005_Post_Creation_Sequence
!theme plain
title UC005 — Automatic feed-post creation
actor "Project owner" as Owner
participant "public/js/app.js" as App
participant "src/routes/project.routes.js" as Routes
participant "src/services/projectService.js" as Service
participant "src/db/database.js" as Data
database PostgreSQL as DB

Owner -> App : Save project through UC002
App -> Routes : POST /api/projects with active session
Routes -> Service : Validated creation request and authenticated owner
note over Routes, Service
  Reuse UC002 authentication, field validation,
  and file storage before the database transaction.
end note
Service -> Data : createProject(project, ownerId)
Data -> DB : BEGIN; insert project, media, optional notes/build
Data -> DB : INSERT feed_posts(id, project_id, created_at)
Data -> DB : COMMIT
DB --> Data : Project and eligible post committed together
Data --> Service : Saved project
Service --> Routes : Saved project
Routes --> App : 201 Created (existing UC002 response shape)
App --> Owner : Confirm project saved
@enduml
